ird equation states that ${x}_{3}=-3.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-(-3)=\\frac{9}{2}.\n$$\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}=\\frac{9}{2}-(3)=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$ and ${x}_{3}=-3$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-2(\\frac{3}{2})-(-3)=- \\frac{27}{2}.\n$$\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=- \\frac{27}{2}-(-3)-(3)=- \\frac{27}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is ${x}_{1}=- \\frac{27}{2}$, ${x}_{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$, and ${x}_{3}=-3.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{27}{2} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674028 1080 "⟨8,-5,-3⟩" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674028 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674028 1083 #uuid "65572018-68fd-5cbb-af18-1aeb63cd8492" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674029 1068 #edb/ref 17592186674035 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674029 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674029 1071 "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=7 \\\\ {x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=-8 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674029 1072 #uuid "678a7444-7b47-530a-afba-3b15ed69e474" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674029 1074 "The third equation states that ${x}_{3}=4.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-(4)=-8.\n$$\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}=-8-(-4)=-4.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=-4$ and ${x}_{3}=4$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-(-4)+(4)=7.\n$$\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=7-(4)-(4)=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is ${x}_{1}=-1$, ${x}_{2}=-4$, and ${x}_{3}=4.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n⟨-1,-4,4⟩.\n$$" 13194139538892 17592186045443 true] [17592186674030 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{17}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{11}{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bma